---
import AdventureMedia from './AdventureMedia.astro';
import AppScreen from './AppScreen.astro';
const { ja } = Astro.props;
const decisions = ja ? [
 ['01 / BUILD', '今の助けを、次の強さへ。', '獲得したバフは次のステージへ持ち越し。正解線スタートを取ると、その上位版が候補に加わります。別の効果を足すか、今の強みを伸ばすか。'],
 ['02 / REROLL', 'この3択で決める？ 引き直す？', '欲しいバフが出るとは限りません。回数制限のあるリロールで候補を引き直すか、今ある選択肢で攻略を組み立てるかも腕の見せどころ。'],
 ['03 / TRADE-OFF', '育てたバフを、手放す選択も。', '「バフリロール増加」を持っていると、ステージ2・3では「ステージスキップ」が出る可能性も。ステージを飛ばす代わりに、それまでのバフをすべて失います。'],
] : [
 ['01 / BUILD', 'Turn an early pick into a stronger build.', 'Carry buffs into the next stage. Pick Correct Lines Start and its upgrade can appear later. Add a different effect, or strengthen what you already have?'],
 ['02 / REROLL', 'Take a pick. Or take another chance.', 'The buff you want may not appear. With limited rerolls, decide whether to redraw the three choices or make the most of the options in front of you.'],
 ['03 / TRADE-OFF', 'Give up your build to skip a stage?', 'With Buff Reroll Increase, Stage Skip can appear in stages 2 and 3. It lets you skip a stage, but costs you every buff you have collected so far.'],
];
---
<section id="adventure" class="app-adventure section" aria-labelledby="adventure-title">
 <div class="wrap">
  <div class="adventure-feature">
   <div class="adventure-feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{ja ? 'パズルに、選ぶ楽しさを' : 'A LITTLE STRATEGY. A NEW CHALLENGE.'}</p><h2 id="adventure-title">{ja ? 'どの強化で、' : 'Which upgrade'}<br/><span>{ja ? '次に挑む？' : 'will you choose?'}</span></h2><p>{ja ? 'ヒントを増やす？ ミスを防ぐ？ 3つの候補から、パズルを助ける「バフ」をひとつ選択。選んだ効果を重ねながら、全4ステージを解き進めます。' : 'More hints? Protection from mistakes? Choose one of three buffs to help with your puzzle, then combine their effects across four stages.'}</p>
    <ol class="adventure-flow"><li><span>01</span>{ja ? '強化を選ぶ' : 'Pick an upgrade'}</li><li><span>02</span>{ja ? 'パズルを解く' : 'Solve the puzzle'}</li><li><span>03</span>{ja ? '次のステージへ' : 'Take it to the next stage'}</li></ol>
    <p class="challenge-note">{ja ? 'デイリーチャレンジでは、合計タイムで月間ランキングに挑戦。' : 'Take on the daily challenge and compete for the best total time on the monthly leaderboard.'}</p>
   </div>
   <figure class="buff-screen"><AppScreen src="/images/buffs.jpg" alt={ja ? '3つの強化から選ぶ、アプリのバフ選択画面' : 'The app’s buff selection screen with three upgrades'} ja={ja}/><figcaption>{ja ? 'アプリの強化選択画面' : 'Buff selection · Japanese screen shown'}</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
  <details class="adventure-details"><summary>{ja ? 'バフの組み合わせと挑戦ルールを詳しく見る' : 'Explore buff combinations and challenge rules'}<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="adventure-details-content"><AdventureMedia ja={ja}/><div class="adventure-decisions">{decisions.map(([label,title,description])=><article><h4>{title}</h4><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div><p class="detail-availability">{ja ? '後半ほど高いティアのバフが出やすくなります。デイリーは通常1日1回。追加挑戦は100 SP。Legendプランでは1日5回に加え、ランキング対象外のトレーニングも利用できます。' : 'Higher-tier buffs become more likely in later stages. One daily attempt as standard; additional attempts cost 100 SP. The Legend plan includes five daily attempts and unranked training.'}</p></div></details>
 </div>
</section>
